Subject: Plan for Cantor M2B Platform Preflight Forms

& [PlanIdentity] is pure implementation only
  + [profile] is cantor-windows-platform-preflight/0.1
  + [authority_required] is valid SJS signature

& [Step01] verify authority and clean code boundary
& [Step02] make the existing volume-GUID validator crate-visible without changing semantics
& [Step03] implement one strict effect-free platform_preflight_forms module
& [Step04] export the module and vocabulary from cantor_ecosystem
& [Step05] add focused tests for profile, target, paths, outcomes, faults, complete records, dispositions, bounds, and strict JSON
& [Step06] statically reject windows-sys, unsafe, filesystem, handle, FFI, process, environment, clock, random, network, persistence, fixture, candidate, scanner, and receipt effects
& [Step07] run focused debug and overflow-checked release proof
& [Step08] run global debug, overflow-checked release, format, lint, build, docs, and audit
& [Step09] regenerate every affected evidence manifest in dependency order
& [Step10] close solution, proof, completion review, readiness, narrative, map, reentry, and publication

& [StopRule] is strict
  + [stop] on any Windows function call, unsafe, Cargo change, physical observation, semantic contradiction, or failed gate
  + [repair] requires source preservation and SJS revision
